      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "As per the prosecution story, the allegation is that petitioner on the false promise of marriage,\nsexually assaulted the victim girl 'X' and this resulted into 22 weeks pregnancy and the allegation is that he later fled from the place to Gujarat.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1156,
      "end": 1402,
