      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Accordingly, the FIR.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1403,
      "end": 1424,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "As per the observation of the learned Sessions Judge, the date of birth of the victim girl is 2007, the FIR is of 2022 Patna High Court CR. MISC. No.30054 of 2023(3) dt.19-08-2023 which clearly shows that at the time of the sexual assault as also the FIR she was minor.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1425,
      "end": 1695,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Patna High Court",
          "label": "COURT",
